sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Cliente (celular)
    participant G as api-gateway
    participant R as Redis
    participant W as weather-service
    participant A as air-quality-service
    participant K as risk-service
    participant T as traffic-service
    participant S as alert-service
    U->>G: GET /api/environment?lat&lon
    G->>R: GET env:lat,lon (cache)
    par chamadas em paralelo (Promise.allSettled)
        G->>W: GET /weather
        G->>A: GET /air-quality
        G->>K: GET /flood e /inversion
        G->>T: GET /flow
    end
    A--)R: PUBLISH air-quality-alerts (se IQA >= 80)
    R--)S: mensagem entregue ao assinante
    W-->>G: clima
    A-->>G: qualidade do ar
    K-->>G: riscos
    T-->>G: trânsito (ou falha)
    G->>R: SET env:lat,lon (TTL 300 s)
    G-->>U: JSON + status de cada parte (live / cache / unavailable)
